<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#F3ECE2;">
<div style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;">Your refund for order {{ name }}</div>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#F3ECE2;">
<tr><td align="center" style="padding:28px 12px;">
<table role="presentation" class="mim-card" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:100%;max-width:600px;background:#ffffff;border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;">
<tr><td align="center" style="padding:30px 20px 18px;border-bottom:1px solid #EEF6F7;">
<a href="{{ shop.url }}" style="text-decoration:none;"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0071/9054/4487/files/mim-logo-hires.png" alt="MIM Creative Wear" width="132" style="display:block;width:132px;max-width:132px;height:auto;border:0;"></a>
</td></tr>
<tr><td class="mim-pad" style="padding:34px 40px 8px;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;">
<p style="margin:0 0 10px;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#00737E;font-weight:bold;">Order {{ name }}</p>
<h1 class="mim-h1" style="margin:0 0 14px;font-size:30px;line-height:1.2;font-weight:600;color:#14272B;">Your refund is on its way</h1>
<p style="margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:1.65;color:#5C6B6E;">{% if amount %}We've refunded <strong>{{ amount | money }}</strong> to your original payment method. {% else %}We've issued a refund to your original payment method. {% endif %}Your bank may take a few days to show it.</p>
</td></tr>
<tr><td class="mim-pad" align="left" style="padding:22px 40px 30px;">
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0"><tr><td style="background:#008F9D;border-radius:999px;">
<a href="{{ order_status_url }}" style="display:inline-block;padding:15px 30px;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:999px;">View your order</a>
</td></tr></table>
</td></tr>
<tr><td class="mim-pad" style="padding:6px 40px 26px;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#5C6B6E;">For cash on delivery orders we'll agree the refund method with you. Questions? Reply to this email.</td></tr>

<tr><td class="mim-pad" style="padding:0 40px 32px;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background:#EEF6F7;border-radius:16px;">
<tr><td style="padding:18px 20px;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#14272B;">
<span style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#00737E;font-weight:bold;">Hand-printed in Cairo</span><br>
Every MIM piece is printed by hand with real leaves, sunlight or carved blocks, so no two are exactly alike. Yours is one of a kind.
</td></tr></table>
</td></tr>
<tr><td style="background:#14272B;padding:26px 40px;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#ffffff;" class="mim-pad">
<p style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:15px;font-weight:bold;">Questions? We're happy to help.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.7;">
<a href="https://wa.me/201222116237" style="color:#7FD3DB;text-decoration:none;">WhatsApp +20 12 22116237</a><br>
<a href="mailto:mim@mimcreativewear.com" style="color:#7FD3DB;text-decoration:none;">mim@mimcreativewear.com</a><br>
<a href="https://www.instagram.com/mimcreativewear" style="color:#7FD3DB;text-decoration:none;">Instagram @mimcreativewear</a>
